{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Please note: this game is still undergoing development and will recieve regular updates and bug fixes)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrickLayer draws from the classic and timeless formular of block building,\u00a0focusing on calm creativity, not pressure or progression. There are no timers or combat. Just you, a world of bricks, and the atmosphere that surrounds them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/a2e74447faf110425879e4fbd665e267.poster.avif?t=1770600744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/a2e74447faf110425879e4fbd665e267.webm?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/a2e74447faf110425879e4fbd665e267.mp4?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Product Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brick Based Construction with:\u00a0</strong>Emissive, transparent, and metallic bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Terrain Generation:</strong>\u00a0Infinite base plate, trees and grass generation (adjustable render distance, trees and grass can be disabled).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animals:</strong>\u00a0Peaceful animal NPCs wander the world to give the sandbox more life, but can be disabled at any time depending on the player's preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Graphics Settings:</strong> To allow players with lower end computers to play with good performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Music:</strong>\u00a0Ambient music will play at random times. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple World Slots:</strong>\u00a0Players aren't limited to one world slot for their builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ways of Movement:</strong> Players can walk and fly, this allows players to build with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather:</strong>\u00a0Fully <strong>dynamic weather</strong> including rain, storms, auroras at night, and rainbows by day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and Night Cycle:\u00a0Time-of-day lighting</strong> that transforms your builds naturally. The player is also given the ability to pause both the time and the weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, revisit, and expand your worlds at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.poster.avif?t=1770600744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.webm?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.mp4?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/3fb1cd0fa36676625354c1be931dfb2a.poster.avif?t=1770600744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/3fb1cd0fa36676625354c1be931dfb2a.webm?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/3fb1cd0fa36676625354c1be931dfb2a.mp4?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/0e29f4c39d4c4364a596b8d4f24ee060.poster.avif?t=1770600744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/0e29f4c39d4c4364a596b8d4f24ee060.webm?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/0e29f4c39d4c4364a596b8d4f24ee060.mp4?t=1770600744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Awesome Person Achievement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909510/7df5f319968b9272603243645e2248923635332b.jpg"},{"name":"LIGHTNING!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909510/1b3e0ff291112558fd97ca9c6facf0c462158412.jpg"},{"name":"Animal Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909510/cd0749601e189d8298510d016e648ea3b4d586e9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Rabbit!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909510/0c471badf8abaab55ab9448afa4cb8cb45a6c596.jpg"},{"name":"Brick Layer!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909510/5ce3028d38823f633f4b0a784decee1bfdd63bb2.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909510?t=1770600744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909510?t=1770600744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta