truction with:\u00a0</strong>Emissive, transparent, and metallic bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Terrain Generation:</strong>\u00a0Infinite base plate, trees and grass generation (adjustable render distance, trees and grass can be disabled).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animals:</strong>\u00a0Peaceful animal NPCs wander the world to give the sandbox more life, but can be disabled at any time depending on the player's preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Graphics Settings:</strong> To allow players with lower end computers to play with good performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Music:</strong>\u00a0Ambient music will play at random times. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple World Slots:</strong>\u00a0Players aren't limited to one world slot for their builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ways of Movement:</strong> Players can walk and fly, this allows players to build with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather:</strong>\u00a0Fully <strong>dynamic weather</strong> including rain, storms, auroras at night, and rainbows by day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and Night Cycle:\u00a0Time-of-day lighting</strong> that transforms your builds naturally. The player is also given the ability to pause both the time and the weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, revisit, and expand your worlds at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.poster.avif?t=1770600744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.webm?t=1770600744\" type=\"